{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2014-08", "window": 2, "start_date": 1407456000, "end_date": 1408147199, "month_true_total": 131, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 00:57:36 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "11720488", "author": {"steamid": "76561198028903158", "personaname": "Mazzino", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/freerun15/", "num_games_owned": 143, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 497, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 471, "last_played": 1542558719, "avatar": "415a124432eb14d8e5e8e2a5d2784f6f83901f4f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Its a fun to play game but there are not many people online", "timestamp_created": 1408138941, "timestamp_updated": 1408138941, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "11719501", "author": {"steamid": "76561198024089347", "personaname": "Mogie", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198024089347/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 67, "playtime_forever": 4091, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4091, "last_played": 1369292400, "avatar": "77820b5dd1f08cdf9566f0adf26273dc84bbad61"}, "language": "english", "review": "I had a lot of fun playing this game when it was released. People say \"I downloaded it for the tf2 item\" but I downloaded it because I was broke and saw a Free to play game. I don't regret this at all. This game is a third person alien arena game, you choose between specific characters that are given, like L4D, you get to choose between 4 characters, and you can't have two of any character. This is not the best game I have played, but regardless it's worth trying to play the game!", "timestamp_created": 1408133598, "timestamp_updated": 1408133598, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "11718139", "author": {"steamid": "76561198071997563", "personaname": "I will purchase > Divine Rapira", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ughey/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 262, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 262, "last_played": 1408145196, "avatar": "bb2a3c8ca2d14aad3844174f8ba8a9c51dc84f66"}, "language": "english", "review": "Bretty gud game, shame it wos so ez doe", "timestamp_created": 1408127052, "timestamp_updated": 1408127052, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "11716101", "author": {"steamid": "76561198124017531", "personaname": "SteFaN-GoD 2", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SteFaNeTare/", "num_games_owned": 29, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 652, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 122, "last_played": 1420304292, "avatar": "6a51bbb935f1f3f1a069c4fd569ee2c97e67727c"}, "language": "english", "review": "this game is ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ awsome", "timestamp_created": 1408117313, "timestamp_updated": 1408117313, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "11709008", "author": {"steamid": "76561197976324852", "personaname": "{VOID} Shabooms", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197976324852/", "num_games_owned": 369, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 2190, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1560, "last_played": 1443245443, "avatar": "7b511c840ae3288f604ea2a30d2c0bef66a13df0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Short version:\nGood: Cooperative play, dynamic squad (technician, healer, DPS, buff leader), easy controls, FREE\n\nBad: Need three players, people play at odd times.\n\n\nLong Version:\nAlien Swarm is something many people should try considering it has given me a blast and its FREE. Its a cooperative aerial view shooter with a large amount of varied equipments to fit to different play styles, situations and roles within the your four person (or less) team. The goal of the game is to simply, to cross the map while surviving the a swarm of spiky hungry aliens that think space marine will be their next meal. The game reminds me a lot of Left 4 Dead, Rainbow Six Vegas, and Diablo (Diablo because I have not played many aerial view games and the graphics are very well polished - like diablo). \n\nIt has two short comings (for me at least only two) are that the game is a bit short, it has 10 levels or so that can be replayed 2 or 3 times in a single week before getting stale. The second is there are not always players online to fill out a full 4 player squad, the game can be done with as little as two players but three is ideal.\n\nWith all this said, remember its not a cheap game, its a free game- so get it, RIGHT NOW.", "timestamp_created": 1408069344, "timestamp_updated": 1408070927, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}]}